    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe in-memory store for ingestion lineage records. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_lineage_record" kindref="compound">IngestionLineageRecord</ref></computeroutput> objects produced during ingestion runs. The store is owned by the <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_manager" kindref="compound">IngestionManager</ref></computeroutput> and populated automatically when lineage tracking is enabled via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_manager_1aa70a819baa8f93bb3400b20cf284c8c1" kindref="member">IngestionManager::enableLineageTracking()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Querying is always available even if tracking is disabled; in that case the store simply remains empty. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
